WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.160 --> 01:31.960
Magical World, 42332.

01:31.960 --> 01:34.540
Year of the Crown...
Month of the Sword...

01:35.500 --> 01:38.500
Vanilla and I are breaking
into the Human World!

01:42.800 --> 01:44.090
Kyahoo!

01:44.090 --> 01:46.220
So this is the entrance
to the human world!

01:46.970 --> 01:48.850
Are we really going, Chocolat-chan?

01:50.140 --> 01:51.890
Yeah, of course!

01:55.600 --> 01:57.900
Chocolat, Hearts, and the Shooting Star.

01:59.900 --> 02:01.900
A bit before that-kero...

02:03.400 --> 02:06.870
The Magical World Senate's
Queen Selection Committee

02:06.870 --> 02:09.660
has formally chosen you two as
the candidates to be Queen.

02:11.410 --> 02:13.420
From now on you will
experience the Human World

02:13.420 --> 02:16.370
and complete fairly to become the next Queen.

02:18.130 --> 02:19.630
Stand, both of you.

02:21.800 --> 02:23.340
Chocolat Meilleure.

02:23.840 --> 02:24.970
That's me!

02:25.300 --> 02:26.680
Vanilla Mieux.

02:26.680 --> 02:27.140
Here...

02:27.640 --> 02:30.430
We bestow upon you a pendant and a wand.

02:44.940 --> 02:45.650
Alright!

02:58.120 --> 03:00.090
Yeah! It's a wand!

03:00.420 --> 03:02.500
If I have a wand I can do anything!

03:03.210 --> 03:05.760
I thought I'd never be able to get one!

03:05.970 --> 03:07.300
Don't get ahead of yourself.

03:07.880 --> 03:10.300
Queen Candy will now speak.

03:11.220 --> 03:13.310
Both of you, listen well.

03:13.720 --> 03:18.730
Padparadscha is a sparkling star,
or "briller etoile". It is a magical crystal.

03:18.730 --> 03:22.020
The pink and green of the watermelon
tourmaline below is

03:22.020 --> 03:24.280
a spiral of flowers, or "fleur spiral."

03:24.610 --> 03:28.450
The top is an incantation for a
spring breeze, milky quartz.

03:28.450 --> 03:30.770
The pearl below is a bubble bath.

03:30.770 --> 03:33.330
And below that is a tear of celestite.

03:33.330 --> 03:37.330
To better understand what your partner
likes, "aromatique", a rhodonite.

03:37.910 --> 03:42.590
But if you don't practice your magic,
you won't be able to use them well.

03:43.290 --> 03:47.970
What's this? Even if it was only once,
I wanted to summon the guard dog of hell...

03:53.810 --> 03:54.680
Mama...

03:55.100 --> 03:56.890
Vanilla, you must stand up for yourself.

03:57.680 --> 04:01.440
Believe in yourself and use
your own power to fight.

04:01.770 --> 04:03.270
And Chocolat as well...

04:03.270 --> 04:06.820
Learn many things in the Human World.

04:06.820 --> 04:07.440
Sure!

04:07.900 --> 04:09.940
When you two become
wonderful witches,

04:09.940 --> 04:12.870
appropriate to become Queen, return to the Magical World.

04:13.910 --> 04:16.540
From then, they prepared for the ritual.

04:18.080 --> 04:21.830
And so those two came to the entrance
to the Human World.

04:24.040 --> 04:26.380
Now, two little witches...

04:26.380 --> 04:27.710
Dive!

04:27.710 --> 04:30.430
Into the cauldron of boiling magma!

04:31.930 --> 04:33.050
Dive!

04:33.970 --> 04:35.470
Chocolat-chan, wait for me!

04:35.850 --> 04:37.350
But... I have to go too.

04:44.940 --> 04:46.570
It's not hot-kero...

04:47.150 --> 04:49.440
It tastes like chocolate in here...

04:49.440 --> 04:50.450
I can't take it...

04:58.370 --> 04:59.500
All right, Hiroshi!

05:00.000 --> 05:04.040
That's Ursa Minor...
and next to it is Ursa Major.

05:05.210 --> 05:07.380
Even though it's just a constellation,
his father is next to him.

05:08.840 --> 05:12.090
My old man left for
Argentina, leaving me alone.

05:13.180 --> 05:14.050
That's over here-kero.

05:14.720 --> 05:16.510
But I can stay up as late as I want!

05:16.720 --> 05:18.010
Play as many games as I want!

05:18.180 --> 05:20.640
And use my old man's telescope all I want!

05:27.440 --> 05:28.480
What the heck is that?

05:34.610 --> 05:36.370
Vanilla, use magic!

05:36.370 --> 05:37.580
Do a flying spell or something!

05:37.580 --> 05:39.700
But, so suddenly. ..

05:39.950 --> 05:42.040
I have no choice, I'll just do whatever...

05:43.000 --> 05:45.790
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

05:50.380 --> 05:51.760
Flowers are blooming.

05:55.010 --> 05:57.350
Sorry, that's the only spell I could cast.

05:57.350 --> 06:00.220
If I had known this was going to happen, I
would've studied magic more seriously!

06:05.900 --> 06:06.980
Yeah...

06:12.150 --> 06:15.410
Well, looks like it's about
time to pick them up.

06:19.780 --> 06:21.580
Fleur Tempete!

06:27.420 --> 06:29.170
Nice catch...

06:33.800 --> 06:35.550
What's going on?

06:35.970 --> 06:38.050
Hope I didn't keep you
waiting, Mademoiselles.

06:38.720 --> 06:41.470
Welcome to the Human World
of swirling desires.

06:41.680 --> 06:42.770
W-Who are you?!

07:00.990 --> 07:03.200
This will be your house starting today.

07:04.250 --> 07:08.080
Now, let's make a toast to the two
new candidates for Queen.

07:09.330 --> 07:12.550
The daughter of her majesty, Queen
Candy, Vanilla Mieux.

07:12.550 --> 07:13.590
Y..Yes.

07:13.590 --> 07:17.630
And the daughter of the witch Cinnamon,
Chocolat Meilleure...

07:17.630 --> 07:18.630
Uh... She's not here?

07:20.050 --> 07:23.600
Hey hey, Vanilla! This place
has two bathrooms!

07:23.600 --> 07:25.390
How luxurious!

07:25.390 --> 07:29.650
Plus the house is built on the
roof. The view is awesome!

07:30.560 --> 07:33.820
I'd heard that the Human World was lame,

07:33.820 --> 07:35.650
but I might actually enjoy living here.

07:36.370 --> 07:38.800
Hmm... She's got some nerve.

07:39.780 --> 07:42.120
By the way, do you know who I am?

07:42.660 --> 07:46.660
I'm a Prince in the Magical World, and
a Super Star in the Human World...

07:47.160 --> 07:49.170
I am the Rockin' Robin!

07:49.460 --> 07:52.380
Uh... Is it possible you don't know who I am?

07:52.380 --> 07:55.170
See, sometimes I'm on TV, and I sing...

07:55.510 --> 07:57.300
Nope. Not a clue.

07:57.300 --> 08:00.130
We don't really know much
about the Human World.

08:00.590 --> 08:05.010
You may be popular among humans,
but you can't fool us witches.

08:05.180 --> 08:07.430
We won't fall for you so easily.

08:07.980 --> 08:12.270
"The heart is yours to take. But you must
not allow your own to be taken."

08:13.190 --> 08:14.440
That's the code of the Magical World.

08:15.020 --> 08:17.400
Ok... So what are you going to
do with the hearts you take?

08:17.820 --> 08:18.400
Vanilla?

08:18.400 --> 08:19.400
Well... um...

08:19.860 --> 08:22.950
That's easy! We use magic to turn them
into crystals, and collect them!

08:22.950 --> 08:27.080
I can't wait! Hearts are tough to
come by in the Magical World.

08:27.450 --> 08:28.330
Right, Vanilla?

08:28.540 --> 08:29.410
Um, yeah...

08:30.620 --> 08:33.460
You brought your heart holders, correct?

08:33.710 --> 08:36.460
Yes, I did. Mine is heart shaped.

08:36.880 --> 08:38.460
And mine is in the shape of a diamond.

08:38.850 --> 08:40.380
Excellent.

08:40.380 --> 08:42.930
From now on, you two are rivals.

08:42.930 --> 08:46.680
The one who captures the most hearts will
become the next Queen of the Magical World.

08:47.640 --> 08:51.980
Your sweet, fierce journey of the
battle for love now begins!

08:54.690 --> 08:56.690
That guy, he was weirder
than I thought he'd be.

08:58.070 --> 09:01.150
But I don't like boys, they scare me.

09:03.450 --> 09:05.660
I don't think I'll be able to
capture their hearts at all.

09:05.660 --> 09:06.660
You ready?!

09:06.450 --> 09:07.660
Scary!

09:08.040 --> 09:11.620
You're so popular in the Magical World,
Chocolat-chan, you should be fine.

09:12.080 --> 09:16.040
When I was told I was a candidate,
I was really surprised.

09:17.040 --> 09:19.920
Vanilla is a princess and comes from royalty.

09:20.720 --> 09:24.550
Compared to her I'm from a poor
family. Just me and my grandpa.

09:25.550 --> 09:28.100
My grandpa who didn't
even come to see me off.

09:28.890 --> 09:33.600
My mom lost to Vanilla's mom in the last contest
to become Queen, and then passed away.

09:34.190 --> 09:37.360
Don't worry, I want you to become
Queen, Chocolat-chan.

09:37.360 --> 09:39.900
I'll become a baker in the Magical World.

09:39.900 --> 09:41.070
Vanilla...

09:41.400 --> 09:44.240
We promised, right? Whoever wins...

09:44.240 --> 09:46.200
...and whoever becomes Queen...

09:46.910 --> 09:48.990
We'll be best friends forever.

09:53.830 --> 09:56.500
Human Girl... Transform!

09:57.980 --> 10:00.850
Private School Moegi Gakuen

09:58.500 --> 10:00.840
Shall we, Mademoiselles?

10:01.880 --> 10:05.090
This is the school in the Human
World you are transferring to.

10:06.680 --> 10:08.600
Excuse me, I have a question!

10:09.140 --> 10:10.560
Can we start collecting hearts today?

10:11.220 --> 10:13.600
Sure, as many as you want.

10:14.890 --> 10:18.610
By the way, your names will be "Chocolat
Kato" and "Vanilla Ice", okay?

10:18.610 --> 10:21.360
I put thought into making your names
sound authentic and Japanese.

10:21.980 --> 10:23.110
I have another question!

10:23.610 --> 10:25.740
Can you summon the
guard dog of hell, Robin?

10:26.990 --> 10:28.620
It's not really my style...

10:28.610 --> 10:31.610
Teacher's Office

10:29.950 --> 10:31.160
Excuse me...

10:33.370 --> 10:37.830
I don't believe it! The transfer student's
father is... Rockin' Robin?!

10:37.960 --> 10:38.750
He's so amazing...

10:38.960 --> 10:40.460
I'm a huge fan of his!

10:40.460 --> 10:42.130
I didn't realize he had kids!

10:43.710 --> 10:45.470
Everybody, calm down...

10:46.380 --> 10:51.640
I'm Kato-san and Ice-san's homeroom teacher,
5th grade class A's Mochizuchi Sachiko.

10:52.140 --> 10:54.480
Wow... he is really popular.

10:54.680 --> 10:55.350
Yeah.

10:56.730 --> 10:58.650
Watch closely, you two.

10:58.650 --> 11:00.150
Make your "peek-a-boo" glasses...

11:02.110 --> 11:03.650
The teachers' hearts are...

11:03.650 --> 11:04.690
...gleaming!

11:04.820 --> 11:07.700
Pink... Purple... And so big!

11:08.240 --> 11:10.200
Are you ready? My babies...

11:10.830 --> 11:13.240
Extase tentation!

11:13.450 --> 11:15.870
Your hearts... come to me!

11:23.300 --> 11:24.550
Amazing...

11:24.550 --> 11:26.760
This is the heart summoning spell!

11:27.340 --> 11:28.970
See you later. Good luck.

11:30.390 --> 11:32.260
My... What was I...?

11:33.060 --> 11:35.100
Now, let's get you girls to class.

11:35.730 --> 11:39.020
When you take their hearts, their strong
emotions will be subdued.

11:39.900 --> 11:41.730
Amazing... So cool!

11:42.270 --> 11:44.150
More than ten hearts
collected in one second!

11:44.690 --> 11:45.900
Is he some kind of genius?

11:58.160 --> 12:00.460
This is Chocolat and
Vanilla's classroom-kero!

12:01.500 --> 12:04.500
Alright everyone, let's have our new transfer
students introduce themselves.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.550
First, Kato-san...

12:06.550 --> 12:07.170
Right.

12:11.340 --> 12:12.720
There are plenty of boys...

12:13.640 --> 12:15.930
Alright, let's take all
your hearts right away!

12:17.140 --> 12:19.440
It's nice to meet you, I'm Chocolat Kato.

12:19.890 --> 12:21.520
She's kinda cute...

12:21.850 --> 12:22.690
You think?

12:23.400 --> 12:25.360
Where did I see her before...?

12:26.570 --> 12:29.740
And if you don't listen to me, I'll whup
your butt! Nice to meet you!

12:30.450 --> 12:31.160
Scary...

12:32.450 --> 12:33.700
Is she looking for a fight?

12:34.330 --> 12:36.490
Huh? Their hearts aren't gleaming at all.

12:37.080 --> 12:39.410
T-Then... Next is Ice-san...

12:41.330 --> 12:41.920
Okay.

12:43.000 --> 12:45.880
They're looking.
Everyone is looking at me...

12:48.550 --> 12:50.380
And whispering things.

12:51.260 --> 12:53.800
What am I going to do? I'm scared.

12:55.300 --> 12:58.310
I... I transferred here.

12:59.390 --> 13:01.730
I... I'm Vanilla Ice.

13:02.350 --> 13:03.850
She's so cute!

13:04.560 --> 13:05.560
Eh?!

13:10.860 --> 13:14.160
Something is strange about
this Human World school.

13:14.570 --> 13:17.370
The boys won't even come near me!

13:18.160 --> 13:19.950
I started to cry...

13:19.950 --> 13:24.670
As for me, I glared at them, I intimidated them.
I thought it would be the perfect introduction.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.130
Look, there's that girl!

13:26.710 --> 13:28.210
Her name's Vanilla!

13:28.210 --> 13:29.590
She's so cute.

13:29.840 --> 13:31.450
Who's that she's with?

13:31.450 --> 13:33.010
That's the other transfer student.

13:33.010 --> 13:34.930
She's one totally scary girl.

13:36.350 --> 13:37.390
She just looked this way!

13:37.760 --> 13:38.760
Run for it!

13:40.430 --> 13:41.180
Could it be...

13:42.100 --> 13:45.100
The Human World is the opposite
of the Magical World?!

13:45.810 --> 13:49.230
In the Magical World, if you intimidate
people when you introduce yourself,

13:49.230 --> 13:52.030
and are scary, selfish,
and maybe even a little mean,

13:52.030 --> 13:54.990
that's the way to be the most popular.

13:57.620 --> 13:59.160
What's the matter, Chocolat-chan?

13:59.490 --> 14:00.580
Where did you transfer from?

14:01.040 --> 14:01.950
Where is your house?

14:06.380 --> 14:09.840
But in this world,
maybe the quiet girl is popular!

14:10.130 --> 14:11.010
Hey, Kato-san!

14:11.380 --> 14:12.340
Wanna eat together?

14:12.670 --> 14:13.220
Sure.

14:14.470 --> 14:16.220
Kato-san, you're different.

14:16.800 --> 14:17.720
Just call me Chocolat.

14:18.100 --> 14:20.720
Hey, does anyone have a boy they like?

14:21.100 --> 14:23.770
You shouldn't ask something
like that so quickly.

14:24.190 --> 14:24.850
Yeah.

14:27.020 --> 14:28.360
Actually, I...

14:29.650 --> 14:32.320
Just give up on that Sugiyama Taiji guy.

14:32.320 --> 14:34.110
You're still just a kid, you know.

14:34.110 --> 14:35.320
Give it a rest!

14:35.320 --> 14:37.910
And anyway, he's always with that Mimura guy.

14:38.070 --> 14:40.200
You'll never get a chance to
be alone together with him.

14:42.790 --> 14:47.370
But today, according to my fortune, the
dark star in my way will disappear,

14:47.370 --> 14:50.920
and a chance to be alone
together will arrive!

14:53.420 --> 14:55.170
S-Sugiyama-kun...

14:55.800 --> 14:57.180
Huh? No way.

14:57.180 --> 14:59.390
Not only is Mimura not around, no one is!

14:59.720 --> 15:02.770
Surely, this is your one big chance
to be alone together!

15:08.560 --> 15:09.480
That was fast.

15:09.480 --> 15:11.320
Momoma, what are you so excited about?

15:12.360 --> 15:13.070
Mimura!

15:13.070 --> 15:14.150
What a jerk!

15:14.150 --> 15:14.650
Momoma?

15:14.940 --> 15:17.030
It's the nickname Mimura made up for Momoko.

15:18.950 --> 15:19.870
What are you doing?

15:20.700 --> 15:22.740
Ooh, Momoma's face is getting all red!

15:22.740 --> 15:24.040
You can do it, Momoma!

15:24.040 --> 15:26.120
Now, attack your loved one!

15:26.330 --> 15:29.750
Fight, Momoma! Fight, Momoma!

15:29.750 --> 15:32.380
This sucks! How'd it end up like this?

15:32.380 --> 15:34.590
Now wait just a second.

15:35.420 --> 15:37.800
Momoma really does like him...

15:39.510 --> 15:41.800
An excited heart is a sign
of budding love.

15:41.800 --> 15:44.010
I won't forgive someone who
prevents it from blooming!

15:44.720 --> 15:45.850
That's enough!

15:47.810 --> 15:49.100
What's with you?

15:49.100 --> 15:51.610
All we were doing was
cheering on Momoma.

15:51.610 --> 15:53.360
If you don't listen to me...

15:56.990 --> 15:59.740
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:16.460 --> 16:17.260
Wand!

16:26.390 --> 16:26.430
Alright!

16:26.520 --> 16:27.430
Alright!

16:30.230 --> 16:32.770
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

16:33.230 --> 16:35.820
The indescribably horrifying
guard dog of hell!

16:36.150 --> 16:37.480
Chocolat-chan, don't!

16:38.190 --> 16:39.570
I summon you!

16:51.540 --> 16:52.080
What the...

16:52.630 --> 16:53.920
What just happened?

16:57.300 --> 16:58.510
What the heck is this?!

16:58.880 --> 17:01.220
What in the world was that just now...

17:03.180 --> 17:05.680
Hiroshi, I told you not to
follow me to school, didn't I?

17:07.560 --> 17:10.060
But I said to summon the
guard dog of hell...

17:10.600 --> 17:14.060
Anyway... If you don't listen
to me, I'll whup your butt!

17:14.060 --> 17:15.480
Chocolat, you're so cool!

17:16.440 --> 17:17.360
Fine, I get it.

17:18.980 --> 17:21.490
But Chocolat-chan,
the boys don't like you.

17:26.080 --> 17:27.950
If you don't listen to us...

17:27.950 --> 17:28.950
We'll whup your butt!

17:29.540 --> 17:31.000
Bye, Chocolat!

17:31.000 --> 17:32.080
See you tomorrow!

17:32.080 --> 17:33.290
Uh, sure!

17:34.380 --> 17:36.840
It's totally impossible to
take a heart like this.

17:37.420 --> 17:39.250
That's not true, Chocolat-chan!

17:39.840 --> 17:40.210
Huh?

17:43.590 --> 17:46.430
Hey now... What're you lookin' at?

17:46.890 --> 17:47.850
What do you want?

17:48.890 --> 17:50.600
Chocolat-chan, your "peek a-boo" glasses.

17:52.850 --> 17:55.230
That... It's small,
but it's a heart. Alright!

17:55.560 --> 17:56.690
Agrandissement!

17:57.270 --> 17:59.530
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

18:01.190 --> 18:04.450
Your heart... Pick up!

18:12.790 --> 18:14.500
You did it, Chocolat-chan!

18:18.790 --> 18:22.010
Huh? What was I doing just now...

18:22.840 --> 18:25.130
It's pretty... A honey colored heart.

18:27.050 --> 18:27.850
That's right.

18:28.550 --> 18:30.850
You guys fell from the sky last night!

18:31.850 --> 18:32.890
He saw us?

18:37.270 --> 18:37.980
What's this?

18:38.400 --> 18:39.520
Give it back!

18:39.520 --> 18:41.070
Fine, then answer my question.

18:41.360 --> 18:44.070
Were you flying in the sky with
the other transfer student?

18:44.950 --> 18:46.820
Sure, just give me back that stone!

18:47.070 --> 18:49.030
I'll return it after I analyze it.

18:49.910 --> 18:51.330
You guys...

18:51.330 --> 18:52.870
...are aliens, right?

18:54.620 --> 18:55.960
Wait just a sec!

18:56.580 --> 19:01.210
This is proof of the discovery of extraterrestrial
beings, that you guys are aliens!

19:01.210 --> 19:02.380
Give it back!

19:11.970 --> 19:13.220
An amber jewel?

19:16.310 --> 19:18.310
Like the color of dawn, beautiful.

19:24.780 --> 19:27.820
This... is yours, correct?

19:29.240 --> 19:31.660
Yeah, it's mine. Give it back.

19:38.870 --> 19:41.750
"Give it back?" But I picked it up for you.

19:42.460 --> 19:44.090
It wasn't like I took it.

19:51.470 --> 19:52.300
Cold...

19:56.600 --> 19:58.190
Don't you know how to thank people?

19:59.520 --> 20:00.350
I'm speechless.

20:03.020 --> 20:04.360
Who the heck is he?

20:05.030 --> 20:07.740
I think he's the head of the student council
in the upper school or something.

20:07.740 --> 20:09.030
Well, never mind him.

20:09.490 --> 20:13.080
Never mind him? That guy was so rude!

20:13.620 --> 20:15.830
Your... face is all red.

20:16.200 --> 20:16.700
Huh?

20:17.040 --> 20:18.210
I'm Mikado Akira.

20:18.710 --> 20:20.960
Well, we'll talk about space
another time, I guess.

20:28.300 --> 20:31.140
It was like a piercing cold.

20:32.850 --> 20:35.220
It felt like I was in the "Rainy Forest"
of the Magical World.

20:44.520 --> 20:48.000
"The heart is yours to take. But you must
not allow your own to be taken."

20:48.570 --> 20:50.110
That's the code of the Magical World.

20:54.910 --> 20:57.140
Somehow I'm tired after
only one day-kero.

21:00.460 --> 21:02.250
And now the reeeesults...

21:04.500 --> 21:07.370
Look, I took one! It's honey colored!

21:09.880 --> 21:12.200
Well, that's a nice way to put it,

21:12.200 --> 21:14.400
but that pale yellow color we call "pee."

21:14.600 --> 21:15.390
Pee?

21:15.390 --> 21:16.720
You know, like, when you pee?

21:17.260 --> 21:18.390
P..Pee?!

21:18.600 --> 21:21.730
Now look at this pile of
hearts I took at my concert!

21:24.270 --> 21:26.860
A crimson heart shows passionate love.

21:26.860 --> 21:29.650
A pink heart contains the
pulsing beat of sweet love.

21:29.650 --> 21:32.070
Yellow means "you surprised me!"...

21:33.030 --> 21:35.990
In other words, yellow colored hearts
are not hearts of love, you see.

21:39.790 --> 21:41.710
And I finally took a heart.

21:42.920 --> 21:45.960
But Mama, I think the Human
World is interesting.

21:46.710 --> 21:49.090
In the velveteen grey night sky,

21:49.090 --> 21:51.970
the stars that shine are small, but real.

21:52.840 --> 21:57.470
It's not like the Magical World where they
are holes cut out of the sky with scissors.

21:58.010 --> 22:01.350
Real stars, shining out with their own light.

22:02.180 --> 22:05.850
Mama... The Queen you
weren't able to become...

22:05.850 --> 22:08.980
I want to become that real star.

22:10.530 --> 22:13.050
A radiant Queen of light!

22:23.100 --> 22:29.410
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.540 --> 22:30.910
"Love"

22:31.850 --> 22:35.350
A magic spell.

22:37.490 --> 22:44.760
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.190 --> 22:54.270
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:55.940 --> 23:00.210
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.810 --> 23:03.880
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.180 --> 23:11.250
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.620 --> 23:16.060
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.060 --> 23:26.170
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.230 --> 23:35.080
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.000 --> 23:48.700
It's hard to use magic in the Human World.

23:48.700 --> 23:51.610
Even though I finally have a wand, it's pointless!

23:51.610 --> 23:54.440
Huh? A familiar will help me?

23:54.440 --> 23:57.440
Okay then, I summon you, my familiar!

23:57.440 --> 24:00.320
But... nothing came out?!

24:00.320 --> 24:03.000
Where did my familiar go?

24:03.000 --> 24:06.690
Fine, whatever... I'll take all the hearts I want with my own power!

24:07.200 --> 24:09.360
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:09.360 --> 24:11.720
the love battle of the frog and mouse.

24:11.720 --> 24:13.360
If you don't watch, I'll whup your butt!

24:13.360 --> 24:14.400
Thanks!
